@incollection{springerlink:10.1007/978-3-642-12384-9_6,
  abstract    = {
                 In this paper, we present a architecture for the development of conversational agents that
                 provide a personalized service to the user. The different agents included in our architecture
                 facilitate an adapted service by taking into account context information and users specific
                 requirements and preferences. This functionality is achieved by means of the introduction of a
